  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a pot over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, sauté until fragrant.",
    "Stir in gochujang and soy sauce until the mixture is smooth.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth and water, bring to a simmer.",
    "Add sliced shiitake mushrooms and cubed tofu, simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Toss in chopped fernroot greens and sliced scallions, cook until the greens wilt, about 5 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste, and a splash of sesame oil for extra aroma.",
    "Serve hot with warm ssam-wraps for a complete meal."
